cent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/downloadable-csv-files/api#datasets-api-details">dedicated datasets API</a></span> that allows downloading tick level <span id="base-ui-_R_7i1l39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/downloadable-csv-files/data-types#incremental_book_l2">incremental order book L2 updates</a></span>, order book snapshots (<span id="base-ui-_R_7j1l39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/downloadable-csv-files/data-types#book_snapshot_25">top 25</a></span> and <span id="base-ui-_R_7k1l39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/downloadable-csv-files/data-types#book_snapshot_5">top 5</a></span>), <span id="base-ui-_R_7l1l39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/downloadable-csv-files/data-types#trades">trades</a></span>, <span id="base-ui-_R_7m1l39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/downloadable-csv-files/data-types#options_chain">options chains</a></span>, <span id="base-ui-_R_7n1l39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/downloadable-csv-files/data-types#quotes">quotes</a></span>, <span id="base-ui-_R_7o1l39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/downloadable-csv-files/data-types#book_ticker">book tickers</a></span>, <span id="base-ui-_R_7p1l39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/downloadable-csv-files/data-types#derivative_ticker">derivative tickers</a></span> and <span id="base-ui-_R_7q1l39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/downloadable-csv-files/data-types#liquidations">liquidations</a></span> data.</p><ul class="min-w-0 space-y-2 decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full"><li class="leading-normal flex items-start"><div class="text-base leading-normal mr-1 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseudoBefore--content) before:font-var" style="--pseudoBefore--content:&#x27;•&#x27;;--font-family:Arial;font-size:min(1.5em, 24px);line-height:1"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col space-y-2"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="page-cover-background:[&amp;:not(:has(.button,input))]:text-contrast-cover has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start">For ongoing data, CSV datasets for a given day are available on the next day around 06:00 UTC. Historical datasets for the first day of each month are available to download without API key.</p></div></li><li class="leading-normal flex items-start"><div class="text-base leading-normal mr-1 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseudoBefore--content) before:font-var" style="--pseudoBefore--content:&#x27;•&#x27;;--font-family:Arial;font-size:min(1.5em, 24px);line-height:1"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col space-y-2"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="page-cover-background:[&amp;:not(:has(.button,input))]:text-contrast-cover has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start">CSV datasets are exported from exchanges&#x27; <span id="base-ui-_R_1td2l39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/faq/data#why-data-source-matters-websocket-feeds-vs-rest-endpoints">real-time WebSocket feeds data</a></span> we collected and also provide via our <span id="base-ui-_R_1ud2l39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/api/quickstart">API</a></span> as historical data in <span id="base-ui-_R_1vd2l39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/faq/data#what-is-a-difference-between-exchange-native-and-normalized-data-format">exchange-native format</a></span>.<!-- --></p></div></li><li class="leading-normal flex items-start"><div class="text-base leading-normal mr-1 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseudoBefore--content) before:font-var" style="--pseudoBefore--content:&#x27;•&#x27;;--font-family:Arial;font-size:min(1.5em, 24px);line-height:1"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col space-y-2"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="page-cover-background:[&amp;:not(:has(.button,input))]:text-contrast-cover has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start">Row order in CSV files reflects the original capture order. When multiple events share the same millisecond exchange timestamp, use row position as the tie-breaker — see <span id="base-ui-_R_vdil39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/faq/data#how-are-events-ordered-when-multiple-messages-share-the-same-timestamp">event ordering FAQ</a></span>.</p></div></li></ul><h2 id="download-via-client-libraries" class="text-xl @xs:text-2xl @lg:text-3xl font-semibold heading pdf-heading block pr-6 pointer-fine:flex pointer-fine:items-baseline pointer-fine:pr-0 scroll-mt-(--content-scroll-margin) text-start self-start justify-start relative group/hash decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid column-first-of-type:pt-0 pt-[1em]" data-heading-reveal-wrapper="true"><span data-cover-aware-text="" class="pointer-fine:flex-1 z-1 justify-self-start max-w-full break-words page-cover-background:text-contrast-cover text-start self-start justify-start leading-tight">Download via client libraries</span><span class="hash inline-grid grid-area-1-1 pointer-fine:h-[1em] border-0 opacity-0 pointer-events-none site-background rounded transition-opacity pointer-fine:pointer-events-auto pointer-fine:group-hover/hash:opacity-100 poin